  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Settlement Names v3.0",
    "description": "The GRID3 COD - Settlement Names v3.0 dataset consists of settlement points with name and attributes for thirteen provinces in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (COD): Province group 1: Haut-Katanga, Kasaï, Kasaï-Oriental, Kinshasa, and Lomami Province group 2: Haut-Lomami and Tanganyika Province group 3: Ituri and Kwilu Province group 4: Maniema Province group 5: Kasaï-Central Province group 6: Tshopo and Mongala This operational dataset has not been fully validated by government officials or ministries. This data release supersedes the GRID3 COD - Settlement Names v2.0 at https://doi.org/10.7916/39b5-mv65. The following changes were made: - Tshopo and Mongala Provinces have been added. Keywords: Settlements",
